  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こんなところにいたのか、探したよ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021004040010,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……何か、ご用ですか",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040210010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202100404/2021004040010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、机にサインの案を置いておいてくれただろう？\r\nすごく良いデザインだったよ、オッケーだ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021004040020,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "そうですか、そのためにわざわざ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100404/2021004040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうって直接伝えたかったんだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "正直に言うと、もっと適当なものが\r\nあがってくるかと思っていたから……嬉しかったんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021004040030,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "あなたを喜ばせるためじゃありません",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100404/2021004040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ、違いない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でもサインはアイドルを続けていく上で大事なものだからさ\r\n……色々、考えてくれたのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021004040040,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "いえ、適当に書いただけです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100404/2021004040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もしかして一発書き？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021004040050,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "一発書き",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100404/2021004040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へえ！　そいつはすごい、驚いた……\r\n円香は才能があるんだなあ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021004040060,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "安っぽい言葉\r\nそういうの、嫌いです",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100404/2021004040060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021004040070,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "私の心を開こうとしているのが見え透くので",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100404/2021004040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ……いや、うーん……！\r\n本当にそう思っただけなんだけど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それとも円香には、\r\n俺が心理戦を仕掛けるような知性派に見えるのかな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021004040080,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100404/2021004040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021004040090,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "──食えない男",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100404/2021004040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021004040100,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "そうやってすぐ笑う\r\n余裕ぶって",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100404/2021004040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうつもりじゃ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……いや、でも余裕は欲しいかな\r\n円香と対等に話したいと思っているからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021004040110,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……対等？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100404/2021004040110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今は無理でも、いつかは俺も、\r\n幼馴染のみんなと同じくらいに──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021004040120,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "は？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100404/2021004040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんて絶対に言わないけどな……！\r\n円香たちの距離感にはとてもじゃないけど近づけないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021004040130,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……少しはわかってきたじゃないですか",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100404/2021004040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "知性派だからな！　ははは……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021004040140,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100404/2021004040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "い、今のはツッコミどころだぞ……！\r\n……ま、まあいいけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
